nt"> <!-- -->2026</span></h1><p class="cine-hero-line mt-7 max-w-lg text-xl leading-relaxed text-text-secondary [animation-delay:500ms] md:text-2xl">This October, in Jerusalem, it happens again.</p><div class="cine-hero-line mt-8 [animation-delay:700ms]"></div><ul class="cine-hero-line mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-10 gap-y-4 [animation-delay:850ms]"><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="grid size-11 flex-none place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent/12 text-accent"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-5"><rect x="4" y="5.5" width="16" height="14.5" rx="2.5"></rect><path d="M4 10h16M8.5 3.5v3.5M15.5 3.5v3.5"></path></svg></span><span class="text-base text-text-secondary md:text-lg">20–21 October 2026</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="grid size-11 flex-none place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent/12 text-accent"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-5"><path d="M12 21s-6.5-5.4-6.5-10.2A6.3 6.3 0 0 1 12 4.5a6.3 6.3 0 0 1 6.5 6.3C18.5 15.6 12 21 12 21Z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10.8" r="2.1"></circle></svg></span><span class="text-base text-text-secondary md:text-lg">The ICC, Jerusalem</span></li></ul><div class="cine-hero-line mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 [animation-delay:1000ms]"><a href="/studio" class="inline-flex min-h-14 items-center rounded-2xl bg-brand px-10 text-base font-medium text-brand-contrast shadow-[0_20px_60px_-14px_rgba(201,161,93,0.6)] transition-all duration-500 hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_26px_72px_-12px_rgba(201,161,93,0.78)]">Register</a><a href="/en/program" class="group inline-flex min-h-14 items-center gap-2.5 rounded-2xl border border-accent/45 px-8 text-base text-accent transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-accent/10"><span class="transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-x-1">←</span>All sessions &amp; workshops</a></div></div></div></section><div class="cine-atmos [--atmos:rgb(122_142_170_/_0.05)]"><section id="story" class="py-28 md:py-40" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(48px)"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-12"><div class="grid items-center gap-14 md:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20"><div class="order-first"><div class="cine-float overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem]"><div class="relative overflow-hidden aspect-[4/5] w-full md:aspect-[5/6]"><div class="absolute -inset-[8%]" style="transform:translateY(-7%)"><img alt="" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/hason-story/1800/1200" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 48vw" class="object-cover"/></div></div></div></div><div><p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-accent">About</p><h2 class="mt-6 block font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight md:text-6xl"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline"><span class="inline-block whitespace-pre" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(0.65em)">Where<!-- --> </span><span class="inline-block whitespace-pre" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(0.65em)">vision<!-- --> </span><span class="inline-block whitespace-pre" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(0.65em)">meets<!-- --> </span><span class="inline-block whitespace-pre" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(0.65em)">execution</span></span><span class="sr-only">Where vision meets execution</span></h2><p class="mt-8 max-w-md text-xl leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">Real change does not happen in documents. It happens when people who believe the same thing share the same room, at the same moment. For two days a year, the people shaping Israel’s public service stop everything — to imagine it anew.</p></div></div><div class="mt-24 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-14 md:mt-28 md:grid-cols-4"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 text-center"><span class="grid size-16 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-accent/12 text-